    <h1>What can and can't be benchmarked from public sources.</h1>
    <p class="detail-sub">
      An honest map for first-time impact GPs. Computed from the {{ peer_benchmarks.verified }}-of-{{ peer_benchmarks.total }} verified peer funds in this dataset. Where data is well-disclosed we show distributions; where it isn't we say so. The questions you can't answer from public sources alone are named at the bottom — those are the ones to ask private comparables.
    </p>
